# THIES' WORLD art. Blocks are 16x16 (2x2 tiles) and use colors 1-3 only: color 0 is kept for the sky, so the
# sun and moon sprites can hide behind anything that is not sky (SPR_BEHIND).
# Background palettes: 0 sky, 1 earth, 2 stone (and the HUD), 3 green, 4 blue, 5 yellow, 6 gold ore, 7 red.
